  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a February 2025 official statement, Steve Feinberg described AI as often high-end data analytics and stressed partnership between operators and technologists. In undated official statements, he said that if confirmed he would cooperate to ensure warfighters can employ drones and AI, prioritize leading-edge AI capabilities including Project Maven, and rapidly deliver AI at scale. He also stated he would ensure the Department of Defense capitalizes on AI benefits for priorities such as the audit. In an October 2026 memorandum as Deputy Secretary of War, Feinberg appointed the Secretary of the Air Force as executive agent for AI-aided ACME classification tools.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4",
    "s5",
    "s6"
   ],
